    "PerkDescription": {
        "ParentObjectID": "cmcperknightcrawler",
        "LocalizationKey": "CharacterTraits_Perk_Nightcrawler_PerkDescription",
        "DefaultText": "You suffer from a rare disease, sun harms you, while darkness nourishes you. You can only leave your dwelling at night or when you wear heavy clothing. People fear you, treating you as a freak, even a legendary creature of darkness. You realize the Inquisition will soon find you, so you fled here. In this jungle far from humanity, you can finally be yourself."
